      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m trying to understand the queue check here.  Does the queue end up in the format of: [hpd_low] [hpd_high] n*[hpd_irq] ?  So we\u0027re only expecting hpd_irq events past the first hpd_high until we hit hpd_low again and clear?",
